From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@local>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] minuspod-local.patch (rebased on upstream d900bdd0)

